    "text": "If the coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math> in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>10</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math> is equal to",
